,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dx=Zx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D278F315-365E-4295-9464-A4F6DE7BE2D8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"遅かった","ts":"1631337026.046200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eQSW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6802D6B0-451C-4480-99A7-76D9AF97DBD4","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://nanto.asablo.jp/blog/2021/09/11/9422241|https://nanto.asablo.jp/blog/2021/09/11/9422241\u003e","ts":"1631337006.045900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LQrD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c85118d3-4b8d-441c-9fe3-7148242ea232","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"手元であるぇ string のままだなーと思ったらまだ 4.3 だった orz","ts":"1631336981.045600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V3cpC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"794552b8-0769-403c-a06a-56bdcf79ce70","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"unknown 集合論的に対応させるとこんなんになります\n\n```空集合 ⊂ {\"a\"}, {\"a\", \"b\"} などの有限集合 ⊂ {\"\", \"a\", ...} = 文字列全体の無限集合 ⊂ {\"a\", 1, class, ...} = 全体集合\n\nnever ⊂ \"a\", \"a\" | \"b\", ... ⊂ string ⊂ unknown```\n\na ⊂ b なら 型b に 型a を代入(static cast)できる、みたいな感じですね","ts":"1631336969.045400","edited":{"user":"US5UW1UNB","ts":"1631337025.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P0MU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f63b7e34-5581-4b37-9c5e-47007b94b5de","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"動的型付けなゆるふわ型世界から来ても TypeScript の型は難しいし、Rust みたいなガチガチ型世界から来ても TypeScript の型は難しい","ts":"1631336936.045000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RZa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ccd4d6f-fe65-4290-b038-2ac5f75434ca","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"`string \u0026amp; {}` は4.3までは `string` になってしまうので `string \u0026amp; {_?:never}` になってるのが LitralUnion ですね","ts":"1631336930.044800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PnBOy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88132691-38b4-4ad8-9778-d9071565d699","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"`LiteralUnion` だ","ts":"1631336803.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CDdW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e6e8068-abd7-4b6e-97f4-23b8b49471d1","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"一応最新でなくとも使えるのが type-fest にあったきがする","ts":"1631336764.043100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Trw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b3fde81-96aa-4606-8b13-90a496c1cf53","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"普通にただの string になってそう…","ts":"1631336673.042100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SIM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c482f479-7274-48c6-8195-49a60917b6c3","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Deno の LSP だからかな？","ts":"1631336189.041800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3PvB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfc8301b-8f77-4f5a-9052-11eeacf28051","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/blob/main/denops_std/function/input.ts#L51\u003e","ts":"1631336180.041500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/blob/main/denops_std/function/input.ts | input.ts\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/blob/main/denops_std/function/input.ts | input.ts\u003e","text":"```\n  completion?: BuiltinCompletion | string,\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std|vim-denops/deno-de