sers":["U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Owu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4aa1d594-24a7-45db-afd9-2cb0cb11c48b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"一般的なキャストと同じと捉えると嵌りそう","ts":"1631335146.035600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4yVQz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0061ecf-2650-4d45-b4ed-e7fc0de9513b","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u0026gt; あくまでも TypeScript に「この unknown 型の値は string だよ」と教えているだけという感じです\n:eyes:","ts":"1631335142.035400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xfx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8e217fe-109b-419b-9747-f01936bc6549","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あくまでも TypeScript に「この unknown 型の値は string だよ」と教えているだけという感じです","ts":"1631335116.034900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i1u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"860c3742-bc47-43a1-bc5b-9ca15e311dd9","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"キャストじゃないんですよ","ts":"1631335086.034400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TGitV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36928974-dc8f-4a13-b213-aca04b219d7f","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"```const apiKey: string = await vars.g.get(denops, \"api_key\"); // エラーになる```\nunknown型のvars.g.getをstringにキャストするのもよくわからない。\n適当な変数に取得して、ensureString()でstring型にすればいいんだけれど、ちょっと冗長な感じ。","ts":"1631335046.034200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WSm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11aad0c4-bfa4-4b72-97c9-13431fb1e82a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"TSの型未だによくわかってなくてLSPが無いと書けない","ts":"1631334880.032700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NVZnF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2ba0429-