,"text":"あえて推論任せにするか、apiKey,apiSecretKey,tokenPathを持つtypeを生やすかな","ts":"1631334096.027700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ESH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90884588-5b14-4bd9-b50c-fbab6c8074a9","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"```  static async getSettings(denops: Denops): Promise\u0026lt;any\u0026gt; {\n    const apiKey = 'a';\n    const apiSecretKey = 'b';\n    const tokenPath = 'c';\n    return await Promise.resolve({ apiKey, apiSecretKey, tokenPath });\n  }```\nこれの型ってなにになるんだろう。\nPromise\u0026lt;Json\u0026gt;やPromise\u0026lt;Array\u0026gt;だとエラーになる…\nPromise\u0026lt;any\u0026gt;で逃げてもいいけれど、なんか気になる。","ts":"1631334036.027300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4BPQe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9af8da51-8441-4969-bf18-50a63e10d8f9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"手元でビルド通らないGoプロジェクトを知ってるので基本無指定はしないな","ts":"1631333801.025200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZiVAb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57e7df0c-83e0-44c7-b4ff-15666e316ac3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"無指定だとローカルではその時のバージョンで固定されちゃう感じですよね、古いGoと同じような","ts":"1631333765.024500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W2aZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66545e6c-0691-4364-9853-40d67596d118","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"これはこれで具体的にどのバージョンが入っているのか分かりづらいのかも\nまあそれは無指定のときも同じか","ts":"1631333167.023300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4xU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"820654b8-8792-4f3a-826a-9c43ff7d87dd","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"これ明示的なんですけど面倒なんですよね〜今のところは厳密にバージョンを指定する必要があります（それを改良しようという話もあります \u003chttps://github.com/tani/lib.deno.dev\u003e","ts":"1631331894.022500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"tani/lib.deno.dev","id":1,"title":"tani/lib.deno.dev","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"8","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"TypeScript","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pln8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80341bc5-9220-47e5-97f1-d14c63fc50d5","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"なるほどー。","ts":"1631331734.020100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MuarQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54ac33c7-b5e2-4ce3-b48e-045a58676e73","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"はい、提示されたケースだとそうなると思います :+1:","ts":"1631331709.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6q38"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa4ab705-1bb8-45cb-81c6-4d48a4260de6","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あぁ、じゃあこの時は bar 0.4 が公開されてても bar 0.2 が入るのかな？","ts":"1631331685.019100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jvc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"927294fa-910c-48ad-8d8c-305bacc35497","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なので udd を実行したときに `0.2#^` が `0.4#^` に書き換えられるかどうか？という感じですねー","ts":"1631331592.017700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FX3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d8db502-9c64-48a5-a287-4181ece4269a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`#^` は udd が書き換えるときの方針です","ts":"1631331553.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uzl45"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffee7e2a-aca5-4c01-8404-673f218ed37e","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"無いですね","ts":"1631331539.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GomR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d18dac1-584b-470f-86b7-c69a9319adf5","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"```benri-app というアプリがあってその中に\nライブラリ foo@0.1#^\nライブラリ foo が bar@0.2#^\nと定義されてたとする。\n時が過ぎてライブラリ bar が 0.4 にアップデートして公開された。\nライブラリ foo 更新されてなくて 0.2#^ と指定されたまま。\n新しくユーザーが benri-app を使って見ようとした時に bar のバージョンは 0.4 が入る。```\nこういうことは起き得ない感じです？","ts":"1631331477.015800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mBhtr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cb52975-03ea-432c-9389-f42a0004b52e","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"`deno sum` みたいなのは今後ありそう","ts":"1631331293.015400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZLZLy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e17bc26b-f9a0-480d-8d55-520dbd9fe59f","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"一応アンサーとしては `import ... \".../mymodule@{ここ}/...` がロックファイル代わりってことになると思います、ただそのサーバーへの信頼ありきですけど (npm も分散だけどhash check がありますからねー)","ts":"1631331243.014500","thread_ts":"1631330100.008100","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BUy"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"0B7D676F-7519-411B-AC53-FA30B0E8B3BB","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"どのバージョンが入ったか正確に分からなくなるので指定しないなぁ。\nNode なら最悪ロックファイル見てバージョン特定出来るけど、deno で ^ で指定された場合って、どのバージョンが使われてるってどうやって判断するんですかねー。キャッシュ探すしかない？","ts":"1631330100.008100","thread_ts":"1631330100.008100","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yRs"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"ae12077f-3323-46bd-bc3d-d0c39000f48c","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"てかあれ、http client ってそもそも #... 送ってないのか…","ts":"1631330492.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tlS5e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a90fc53-52a7-412a-bafc-f10ae022d273","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"deno自身が使ってないから勝手に使っちゃお、というのがuddですね","ts":"1631330414.013800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":fal